--- c-defects attempt 6, 2026-08-31: the third blocked claim IS now measured ---

The paragraph below is superseded. `test_<model>_two_paged_pools_agree_and_a_contiguous_cache
_is_unreachable` - two models in one process - now passes at the full 80-layer shape, three
fresh processes, on BOTH models, at commit 299440bb276:

    z6_llama_two_pools_r1    1 passed   797.78 s
    z8_llama_two_pools_r2    1 passed  1150.68 s
    z9_llama_two_pools_r3    1 passed   820.22 s
